OL,3,GNEWSARelief road approved despite
OL,4,Ahundreds of objections
OL,5,
OL,6,FA controversial relief road plan has
OL,7,Fbeen approved despite hundreds of
OL,8,Fobjections.
OL,10,FThe new road around Carrington in
OL,11,FTrafford, first proposed more than a
OL,12,Fdecade ago, will provide a new route to
OL,13,Fthe M60 and reduce congestion in the
OL,14,Fvillage, the council said, as well as
OL,15,Fopening up the area for new housing.
OL,17,FAbout 5,000 new homes could be built on
OL,18,Fland close to Manchester United's
OL,19,Ftraining ground.
